Z||000005||watts||11-23-2001||11:48 AM|||| <BLOCKQUOTE><font size="1" face="Verdana, Arial, Helvetica">quote:</font><HR>Originally posted by RedOktober:<BR><B>Cool... so thats what an 87/88 DIS 4 cyl oil filter looks like. Never had the chance to see one without the hoist. </B><HR></BLOCKQUOTE><P>Nope - that's what an '88 only looks like without a hoist.  '87 is DIS, but still has the filter at the corner on the outside.<P>You also get a semi good view of the coolant hoses - see how they've changed?  Look up front at the crossmember area.<P>You can also see the trailing links on the rear suspension.<P><P>------------------<BR>87/88 V6 5spd Notchback Hybrid<BR> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/watts_sig.jpg"> ||||reg||1
